  "description": "New extension- to front  at ground floor level. Creation of new cloakroom. Single storey extension to front of property. Materials to match existing. Flat roof with canopy arrangement to blend in with canopy as existing. Extension size 1.5mx2.2m.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, by means of its cumulative impacts in its bulk and scale,&nbsp;would result in a significantly disproportionate dwelling that would fail to appear subordinate to the host dwelling. The development would exacerbate the built form of the dwelling and further imbalance the semi-detached pair. The proposal would cause&nbsp;harm to the character and appearance of the host dwelling and wider street scene.&nbsp;As such, the proposal is contrary to:Paragraphs 131 and 135 of the National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (MHCLG, December 2024)Policies D1 and D4 of the London Plan (March 2021)Policies SP2, DMD1 and DMD5 of the London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan (September 2024)Residential Alterations and Extensions SPD (February 2012)"
